{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 34, "title": "Exorcist demo", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/zsh"}}
[0.5, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ exorcist check incident-2026-10\r\n"]
[2.38, "o", "NOTE:       a minimal model of the mechanism in the NEAR Intents postmortem (Oct 2026), written from scratch \u2014 NOT their contract\r\n"]
[2.5, "o", "RESULT: VIOLATION (insolvent) at depth 8, 26191 states explored in 41 ms. Shortest attack trace:\r\n"]
[2.62, "o", "1. eve sends tx: token.ft_transfer_call(vault, 100, \"notify hook\") (+1 yocto)\r\n"]
[2.74, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=0 (total 300) | tokens: vault=300 alice=0 eve=100\r\n"]
[2.86, "o", "2. run #0 token.ft_transfer_call(vault, 100, \"notify hook\")  \u21d2 returns a promise\r\n"]
[2.98, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=0 (total 300) | tokens: vault=400 alice=0 eve=0\r\n"]
[3.1, "o", "3. run #1 vault.ft_on_transfer(eve, 100, \"notify hook\")  \u21d2 returns a promise\r\n"]
[3.22, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=100 (total 400) | tokens: vault=400 alice=0 eve=0\r\n"]
[3.34, "o", "4. FAIL #3 hook.on_deposit(eve, 100)  \u21d2 adversary makes it fail\r\n"]
[3.46, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=100 (total 400) | tokens: vault=400 alice=0 eve=0\r\n"]
[3.58, "o", "5. run #2 token.ft_resolve_transfer(eve, vault, 100)  \u21d2 ok, returns 0  \u2014 refunds 100 vault \u2192 eve\r\n"]
[3.7, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=100 (total 400) | tokens: vault=300 alice=0 eve=100   \u26a0 INSOLVENT (ledger > tokens held)\r\n"]
[3.82, "o", "6. eve sends tx: vault.withdraw(100)\r\n"]
[3.94, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=100 (total 400) | tokens: vault=300 alice=0 eve=100   \u26a0 INSOLVENT (ledger > tokens held)\r\n"]
[4.06, "o", "7. run #5 vault.withdraw(100)  \u21d2 ok (no value)\r\n"]
[4.18, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=0 (total 300) | tokens: vault=300 alice=0 eve=100\r\n"]
[4.3, "o", "8. run #6 token.ft_transfer(eve, 100)  \u21d2 ok (no value)\r\n"]
[4.42, "o", "     ledger: alice=300 eve=0 (total 300) | tokens: vault=200 alice=0 eve=200   \u26a0 INSOLVENT (ledger > tokens held)\r\n"]
[4.54, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.66, "o", "  \u2713 checked by the Lean kernel (decide): this trace really violates the property\r\n"]
[7.78, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ exorcist prove incident-2026-10-fixed\r\n"]
